course: dictionary
lesson: 5346
title: Killer: one word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A killer is a person, animal or thing that kills. In a news story, the police catch a killer who has done something terrible. Some things can kill too, like poisons, so the word can describe a thing as well as a person.
explain: Killer can also mean something that causes many deaths. «Heart disease is a big killer» tells you that heart disease causes lots of deaths. The context is about illness and health, so this meaning fits.
explain: In slang, killer means very good, impressive or very hard. «That test was a killer» does not mean the test was dangerous: it means the test was very hard. Ask yourself what the sentence is about before you choose a meaning.
fact: A killer is a person, animal or thing that kills.
fact: Killer can mean something that causes many deaths, such as a big illness.
fact: In slang, killer can mean very good, impressive or very hard.
fact: The orca, or killer whale, is the biggest member of the dolphin family.
fact: Weed killer and slug pellets are poisons, so never touch, open or taste garden chemicals.
exercise: «Heart disease is a big killer.» What does killer mean here? | A funny joke | A kind doctor | A very fast runner | *Something that causes many deaths
exercise: «That test was a killer.» What does killer mean here? | *Very hard | Very short | Very easy | Very wet
exercise: «The orca, or killer whale, is the biggest member of the dolphin family.» Which animal is also called a killer whale? | *orca | shark | rottweiler | dolphin
test: «Liquids in the wrong bottle look like drinks, and some, like cleaners or weed killer, can burn the mouth and throat.» According to the text, what can weed killer do? | It makes plants grow | It cools your throat down | It makes your mouth sweet | *It can burn your mouth and throat
test: Kieran says «rottweilers are killers», but then he meets one that flops on its back for a belly rub. What does this show? | Rottweilers are always killers | Rottweilers cannot move | *Kieran's idea was wrong, because that dog is friendly | Kieran is a rottweiler
exam: Sam says «Our maths test was a killer». What does Sam mean? | *It was very hard | It was very short | A person was killed during the test | It was on a boat
Ok
